{
 "profile_id": "laingsburg",
 "profile_name": "Laingsburg Local Municipality (Western Cape)",
 "short_name": "Laingsburg",
 "_doc": "Laingsburg LM. Compact Afrikaans ledger, same print as Swartland: no masthead, no municipal name or VAT number in the text (the only VAT printed is the customer's). Ledger 'dd/mm/yy <meter|code> <BESKRYWING> <VAT> <incl>', readings line 'new - old = n KWH d DAYS', tier lines 'n KWH @ rate = R', 'TAR: <code> BASIES: = R'. Electricity = ELEKTRISITEIT <size>A (energy + basic) + ELEKTRISITEIT METER HUUR; total_ex_vat_r = incl - VAT of both; standard = tier kWh/R; other = basic + meter rental. Fingerprint has to use layout strings: all BALANS OORGEBRING + TOTALE BTW:, any ELEKTRISITEIT / WATER METER HUUR (found only on these bills), and rejects Swartland's EasyPay id and the Oudtshoorn / Matzikama / Matlosana names. 9 of the 11 PDFs are scans whose text layer is only a barcode string (no OCR text in the cache) and stay unrouted. IDENTITY lai_detail_identity_r = tier Rands + all BASIES detail lines vs ledger incl - VAT: 0.00 on 2/2. One READ check: the May-2026 bill prints a register rollover (end reading below start, consumption correct).",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "BALANS OORGEBRING",
   "TOTALE BTW:"
  ],
  "any": [
   "ELEKTRISITEIT METER HUUR",
   "WATER METER HUUR"
  ],
  "reject_if_text": [
   ">>>>>91587",
   "OUDTSHOORN",
   "MATZIKAMA",
   "MATLOSANA",
   "Please wait...",
   "requires Adobe Reader"
  ]
 },
 "sections": {
  "electricity": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{2}[ \\t]{2,}\\S+[ \\t]{2,}ELEKTRISITEIT",
   "require": "ELEKTRISITEIT"
  },
  "sewerage": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{2}[ \\t]{2,}\\S+[ \\t]{2,}RIOOL"
  },
  "water": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{2}[ \\t]{2,}\\S+[ \\t]{2,}WATER[ \\t(]"
  },
  "refuse": {
   "start": "^[ \\t]*\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{2}[ \\t]{2,}\\S+[ \\t]{2,}VULLIS"
  }
 },
 "fields": [
  {
   "field": "account_number",
   "label": "Account number",
   "scope": "document",
   "patterns": [
    "^[ \\t]{2,}(\\d{10,14})-\\d{2}-\\d{2}[ \\t]*$",
    "VERWYSING:[ \\t]+(\\d{10,14})\\b"
   ],
   "type": "text",
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "field": "lai_account_formatted",
   "label": "Formatted account",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]{2,}(\\d-\\d{2,6}-\\d{3,6}-\\d{3}-\\d)[ \\t]*$",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "fields": [
    "lai_valuation",
    "lai_stmt_date",
    "billing_date"
   ],
   "label": "Header: valuation, statement date, account date",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]{5,}(\\d+)[ \\t]{2,}(\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{2})[ \\t]+(\\d{2}/\\d{2}/\\d{2})[ \\t]*$",
   "types": [
    "number",
    "date",
    "date"
   ],
   "required": true
  },
  {
   "field": "lai_street",
   "label": "Street (line above addressee)",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]{10,}(\\S[^\\n]*?)[ \\t]*\\n[ \\t]*TFMC",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "field": "lai_town",
   "label": "Suburb (tail of addressee line)",
   "scope": "document",
   "pattern": "^[ \\t]*TFMC[^\\n]*?[ \\t]{2,}([A-Za-z][A-Za-z .'-]+?)[ \\t]*$",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "field": "lai_total_vat_r",
